            sparkle:edSignature="mlZTBaHewzOnkR6e4/aj9aHPjGfzu664HxmtDi/xrazrb6hx6sumPq70MMKgZ/GMkk9ReFYtEjruyvORwSi5Bw==" />
        <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Preferences</strong> — per-server enable/disable toggle in the server list; disabled servers are excluded from polling and control actions</li>
<li><strong>Shortcuts removed</strong> — keyboard shortcut feature (⌘⌥⇧P) and all menu key equivalents removed</li>
</ul>
<h2>Install</h2>
<ol>
<li>Download <strong>PiGuard-3.6.5-macOS.dmg</strong></li>
<li>Open the DMG and drag PiGuard into <strong>Applications</strong></li>
<li>Launch from Launchpad or Applications</li>
</ol>
<p>Requires macOS 13 or later. Signed with a Developer ID certificate.</p>]]></description>
